"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/15/6276956/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あはは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/15/6276956/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の前の個別握手会ではヤングギターの表紙撮影で頂いた服をあみちゃんと着ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/15/6276956/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うんうん！イケイケだね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/15/6276956/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして前回は全身撮るの忘れちゃったんだけど、白パーカーに黒のミニスカートとあみタイツでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/15/6276956/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも遠くの方から朝早く起きて来てくださったり、グッツを沢山身につけてくれたりと\n嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/15/6276956/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/15/6276956/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近お団子ハマってるの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/15/6276956/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/15/6276956/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか誕生日もうすぐのお話、\n番組やラジオ、雑誌の話し、ライブのことなどたくさんのお話を今回もできてとっても嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/15/6276956/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ね、今回の生誕Tシャツのデザイン今までで1番時間かけてこだわってつくったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/15/6276956/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非楽しみにしててね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/15/6276956/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校卒業しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学1年から上京してきて、最初は学校に馴染めなくて辛い時期がありました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事と学校の両立で焦ったりした事もありましたがそんな時はいつも 先生や友達が支えてくれたり、ファンの方々が声をかけてくれたから頑張ってこれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/15/6276956/0001.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}